  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA - Support for Gender Standby Capacity Project (GenCap)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this contribution is the deployment through the the Gender Standby Capacity Project (GenCap) of senior advisers within gender equality (GE) and gender-based violence (GBV) in humanitarian crises to address capacity needs in GE and GBV programming efforts, in addition to providing capacity development, policy advice and guidance on best practices.</narrative>
